    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Isabella Collazos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102374442432169782798/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcN76A9XMVeGa54etrQqF3_T8bQ7rUklrSbwcOMvYAFWzS9nIB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I’m very dissatisfied and disappointed during my dad’s visit 4 months ago. He went to change his break disks to this garage as my referral, he owns a Mazda Cx5 2021 and when you do these changes you MUST use the small computer to change settings on the system. Well, after long hours of work, the employees took a lot of time which was odd knowing that this procedure doesn’t not take a whole day. My dad asked what was happening and they told him that the car had an issue and they cannot fix it, they made lose 1 day of work to my dad + they left the car with a parking break problem. The issue disappeared after a while and we thought it was fine but 2 days ago the problem came back and I decided to take it to another mechanic to see if there was a problem. The problem was that during the breaks change, the mechanics at Kirpa broke the actuator on the right side which caused the disconnection between parking break, they closed it with too much pressure that the piece was broken at the time I paid for the review, I had to go to Mazda and buy the piece and get it replaced. It costed me around 500$ CAD for a mistake made by employees who you CAN’T talk with to know what’s going on because they don’t speak English or French. I will never come back to this place and I encourage others to NOT to if you want to save money by paying “cash”, trust me, this place will make you pay more. I don’t trust the owner and mechanics anymore, hope this is useful for someone else and I would like very much to receive a compensation for the damage you did on the car.",
        "time": 1768075232,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rahul Phull",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101538022028076009691/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVCVrrWd94sX56fauFwhgJkBuJMs3Bua0Ek4g-vVOXsB56M4SjJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "After seeing the kind of service I got from them, I’m sure most of these reviews on their page are fake. Maybe they are okay for oil change and tire change. They have no value for their word and took way too long to fix my car. If you’re gonna take such a long time at least give me an estimate in advance so I can find another garage.",
        "time": 1768076845,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "genisal",
